# Water ORMAS, ORCA 6.1.1 section 3.13.3.8.
# Each subgroup specifies its orbital count, minimum and maximum
# electron count. Four electrons are shared across all three groups.
! def2-SVP TightSCF SP
%casscf
  nel 4
  norb 4
  mult 1
  nroots 1
  refs
    ORMAS(4: 2 2 4 / 1 0 2 / 1 0 1)
  end
end
* xyz 0 1
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.758602   0.000000   0.586541
H  -0.758602   0.000000   0.586541
*
